# The DOR forms are VENDORED, not ignored. lib/forms/recoveryAgreement.ts reads
# them at RUNTIME, so a deploy or a fresh clone without them throws ENOENT on
# every agreement. They are 752 KB of public government forms, pinned by sha256
# in data/seed/form-hashes.json — vendoring makes generation deterministic and
# offline-capable, and `pnpm verify:forms` still fails CI if DOR revises one.
/data/forms/*.live.pdf
/tmp/
/data/fixtures/
.vercel
.env*
